Doc Detective doesn't detect steps inside JSX components such as `<Steps>`, in any MDX file. Add the click yourself inside the component:

```mdx
{/* test {"testId": "standard-button"} */}

{/* step {"goTo": "http://localhost:8092/"} */}

<Steps>
<Step>

Click **Standard Button**.

{/* step {"click": "Standard Button"} */}

</Step>
</Steps>

{/* test end */}
```
